        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ian Hunter, Stuart Murdoch\n- Roles: singer-songwriters, lead singers, songwriter, writer, filmmaker\n- Bands: Mott the Hoople, Belle and Sebastian\n- Places: Britain, England, Scotland\n\nFacts:\n- Ian Hunter Patterson was born on 3 June 1939 and is a British singer-songwriter known as Ian Hunter.\n- Ian Hunter was the lead singer of the English rock band Mott the Hoople from the band's inception in 1969 until its dissolution in 1974.\n- Ian Hunter was also the lead singer of Mott the Hoople at the band's reunions in 2009 and 2013.\n- Stuart Lee Murdoch was born on 25 August 1968 and is a Scottish musician, writer, and filmmaker.\n- Stuart Murdoch is the lead singer and songwriter for the indie pop band Belle and Sebastian.",
